        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Isaaya mwene Amozi yaatuma ahari Hezeki naagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'okunshaba kukuhwera aha bya Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
