        {
          "text": "Kandi aha karyakubeera akamanyiso; omu mwaka ogu nimwija kurya ebyemerize, omu gwa kabiri murye ebyemeize eby'emiragarika y'ebyo; bwanyima omu mwaka gwa kashatu muryabiba mugyeshe, mubyare emizzaabibu, murye ebijuma byayo. ",
